mment+sync as the durable-position evidence channel (input to microVMs §20.11); the execution-context property the work implies (isolation must be a property of the context, not of a flag-disableable permission block).\n7. Acceptance criteria — what a workable process must demonstrate to count as methodology: reviewers' concerns addressed (threat model, deny-by-default, fail-closed identity), durability primitive verified (sync guard demonstrated), observations fed back to EDASES.\n8. What-not-tested — #344 in flight, --pure source-verified not empirically executed, research half of loop not yet closed, substrate questions untouched.\n9. Conclusion — the fix is implementation-layer, but the process it defines produces research-relevant observations; workable process counts as methodology when the three criteria hold.\n\nVerified: YAML frontmatter parses (pyyaml), metadata matches Documentation Standard (program EDASES, layer Research, type Research Finding, status Active, authority Experimental, depends_on Documentation Standard + both topic docs, related_documents agent-tooling docs + allowlist record), no stub patterns. Committed with [#342] ref per instructions.","created_at":"2026-08-10T03:15:42.725203057Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:JNF8guQJZUi2sfu7QR7x4DRP12GKPzzlcwKYnIJhj1k","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgg6QCMkXz+Ex+8LtXb+fE46Wkp3eJqqYRPlvl//ZAGboAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAkLeY9SKov+mjJirMyA/vgHgx/cbjWIY7S86GcwQ7L2VUnhRv9D4Pax7+QimyoKTw/6c4tEzb4xviXGgJ6J/gAQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:JNF8guQJZUi2sfu7QR7x4DRP12GKPzzlcwKYnIJhj1k","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgg6QCMkXz+Ex+8LtXb+fE46Wkp3eJqqYRPlvl//ZAGboAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGewrH/Xm6czgBzwHqxoBJc0DzGOu9C2CWXMiIG7Os6h5D+9Mi/TbHzFTLE25iGnVPOndBbQdENApolcpWeW3gw="}
